It comes to your mind that you heard about these plants somewhere. And there was a strange word...seda...seti... Anyway, you don't like their smell, and if you go deep into the field, it will obviously become stronger. 

Having made the decision, you move along the field edge, trying to avoid at least these plants. However, their rows are limitless; it seems that there is no end to it. You can see sparse underbrush up ahead that you can walk through towards the lake. You wish to reach it soon because it's getting hot, and the smell is still strong.